 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2016 年 6 月，以太坊上的 The DAO，被提走了约 360 万 ETH。",
   "spoken": "2016 年 6 月，以太坊上的 The DAO，被提走了约 360 万 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 6.079
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "按事发时的价格，约 6000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "按事发时的价格，约 6000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 7.124,
   "dur": 3.696,
   "speechStart": 7.222,
   "speechEnd": 9.984
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "合约没有被破解。",
   "spoken": "合约没有被破解。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.04,
   "dur": 2.112,
   "speechStart": 11.138,
   "speechEnd": 12.316
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "它只是把两行代码的顺序，写反了。",
   "spoken": "它只是把两航代码的顺序，写反了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.372,
   "dur": 3.912,
   "speechStart": 13.47,
   "speechEnd": 16.458
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 17.504,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 17.602,
   "speechEnd": 18.756
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "一个银行合约，金库里有 10 个 ETH。你在里面的余额，是 1 个。",
   "spoken": "一个银航合约，金库里有 10 个 ETH。你在里面的余额，是 1 个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 19.812,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 19.91,
   "speechEnd": 24.907
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "你只调用一次取款函数，最多能取走多少？",
   "spoken": "你只掉用一次取款函数，最多能取走多少？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 25.96,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 26.058,
   "speechEnd": 29.189
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "答案是，全部 10 个。",
   "spoken": "答案是，全部 10 个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 30.54,
   "dur": 2.568,
   "speechStart": 30.638,
   "speechEnd": 32.28
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "前提有两个：银行先转账、后清零。而你，是一个合约。",
   "spoken": "前提有两个：银航先转账、后清零。而你，是一个合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
   "start": 33.328,
   "dur": 6.312,
   "speechStart": 33.426,
   "speechEnd": 38.804
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "你每收到一笔钱，就在收款的那一刻，再调用一次取款。",
   "spoken": "你每收到一笔钱，就在收款的那一刻，再掉用一次取款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-09.mp3",
   "start": 39.86,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 39.958,
   "speechEnd": 43.85
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "账本清零，要等到所有嵌套调用都返回之后。",
   "spoken": "账本清零，要等到所有嵌套掉用都返回之后。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-10.mp3",
   "start": 44.904,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 45.002,
   "speechEnd": 48.811
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "这就是重入。最古老，也最常复发的合约漏洞。",
   "spoken": "这就是虫入。最古老，也最常复发的合约漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-11.mp3",
   "start": 49.876,
   "dur": 4.848,
   "speechStart": 49.974,
   "speechEnd": 53.888
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "这一集讲三件事：控制权在哪里交出去，重入有哪几种，怎样把顺序写对。",
   "spoken": "这一集讲三件事：控制权在哪里交出去，虫入有哪几种，怎样把顺序写对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-12.mp3",
